# Bundled .gan plugin artwork (The Owl) — a required runtime asset, not a capture still
!frontend/public/owl/*.png
# Bundled .gan plugin artwork (Ares) — the VST Foundry export's background.png beside
# its project.json; required to package ares.gan (without it the surface has no background)
!backend/modules/plugin/assets/**/*.png
# The desktop app icon — electron-builder's buildResources auto-discovers it and
# converts to .ico/.icns. It MUST be tracked: a fresh CI checkout otherwise builds
# installers with the default Electron icon (local builds mask this because the
# file exists untracked on the dev machine).
!electron-ui/resources/icon.png

# Byte-compiled / optimized / DLL files
